description	"Tusken Raider Shaman

Tusken Mystics with high utility, prefers to harass and ambush over open combat. 

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Gaffi Stick (Staff/Blue)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- 15% faster Movement
-- 200% Spec Dmg mult
-- 14% more AS
-- Poisons On Hit
-- 20% more Kb
- Projectile Pistol (Clone Pistol 1)
-- Hitscan rounds
-- 6% faster RoF
-- 15% less Dmg
-- 10% less FP Dmg
-- Mag Reload
-- Prim only

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Getup (2)
- Tusken Strength (1)
- Healing (1)
- Anti Mindtrick (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Assemble (1)
- Aerial Force Regen

^8Abilities:
- Tribal Remedies (Health Dispenser 1) ^3[USE In Melee]
- Mend Wounds (Medpack) ^3[CS3]"
